1764:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****       (+) Configure Complementary channels, break features and dead time.
1765:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****       (+) Configure Master synchronization.
1766:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****       (+) Configure timer remapping capabilities.
